ass=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031890/extras/def49de45fcad2c86050f1eaf9838354.poster.avif?t=1785411068\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031890/extras/def49de45fcad2c86050f1eaf9838354.webm?t=1785411068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031890/extras/def49de45fcad2c86050f1eaf9838354.mp4?t=1785411068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destructible Environmental Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Destructible Environmental Elements add realism and strategy to combat. Players can shatter furniture, and use props as weapons, making fights unpredictably chaotic and allowing for creative and ruthless approaches. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031890/extras/de42a389277e8403f077a45684bb3594.poster.avif?t=1785411068\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031890/extras/de42a389277e8403f077a45684bb3594.webm?t=1785411068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031890/extras/de42a389277e8403f077a45684bb3594.mp4?t=1785411068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traditional Parkour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Traditional Parkour mechanics provide fluid movement and dynamic, escapes. Players can run, jump, and climb through levels. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031890/extras/8079bd3144c5cbd548f475a9fbd288ef.poster.av